RedHat has only begun to bundle LVM in their products with RedHat 8.0
released at the end of September.  That being said, the RHAS release cycle
is something like 6-12 months, which probably means that RedHat Q&A will
typically bang/hack away at a product for almost as long before they deem it
"enterprise ready" according to their own standards.  Once the product
passes Q&A, they'll bundle it with RHAS.

I would expect to see some kind of LVM in RHAS 2.2 or 3.0...

Marco

